View: Design::opmPipeline
Title: Request pipeline
Viewpoint: Foundation.Arch::viewpointOperations
Notation: ISO/PAS 19450:2015 OPM, Prism OPL profile

componentAuth is an object.
componentGateway is an object.
componentGateway can be sessionActive or sessionIdle.
routeRequest is a process.
verifyCredentials is a process.
routeRequest requires componentAuth.
verifyCredentials consumes componentGateway.
routeRequest invokes verifyCredentials.
routeRequest zooms into verifyCredentials, in that sequence.
